//     mlir_gen: 2 self-diagnosed malfunction(s) — COMPILE FAILED
// The inner array pattern declares no binding, so `x` is undefined and every dependent statement is
// dropped. ⚠ This is the 14th-kind gate lie's near neighbour and is recorded as such: the object file
// is NOT written and the exit code is 1, so it fails LOUDLY — but a `refuses` row whose refusal is an
// internal malfunction is not a diagnostic, and its fix must produce a real sentence or compile.
// Found 2026-09-16j-arrpath2 by hand program y05, written to test whether that round's recursive leaf
// emitter handles a Slice sub-pattern (path `arr.0.0`). The emitter DOES recurse into Slice; this door
// is upstream of it — the binding never exists, so no move path is ever asked for. Reason 1, no
